1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:34,650
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shino Laugh</font>

32
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino! Let's rest a little!</font>

33
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm tired from doing nothing but
walk since this morning!</font>

34
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're okay while
you can say you are tired.</font>

35
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you still have
energy left to talk.</font>

36
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing but quibbling as usual...</font>

37
00:01:53,050 --> 00:01:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I'm unlucky.</font>

38
00:01:54,010 --> 00:01:56,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be stuck on a mission alone
with Shino.</font>

39
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old lady.</font>

40
00:02:04,850 --> 00:02:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Motoyoshi Village still far ahead?</font>

41
00:02:07,850 --> 00:02:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to Motoyoshi Village?</font>

42
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

43
00:02:11,650 --> 00:02:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you'll be right there
once you cross this path.</font>

44
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? Thank goodness.</font>

45
00:02:17,110 --> 00:02:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But exercise great caution...</font>

46
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dead people also laugh
in Motoyoshi Village...</font>

47
00:02:25,410 --> 00:02:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be all over if
you're lured into laughing.</font>

48
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

49
00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Motoyoshi Village.</font>

50
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We never imagined it at this time...</font>

51
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that in this village...</font>

52
00:02:47,770 --> 00:02:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an incident too terrifying to
even talk about would occur...</font>

53
00:02:56,190 --> 00:02:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In Mourning</font>

54
00:03:10,830 --> 00:03:13,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Futa Kagetsu, the chief mourner.</font>

55
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Aburame Shino.</font>

56
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

57
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"WILL"</b></font>

58
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Getting right down to business...</font>

59
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the will of my father,
Tobei Kagetsu.</font>

60
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

61
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eldest son, Futa Kagetsu,</font>

62
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">shall inherit the entire
Kagetsu family estate...</font>

63
00:03:34,150 --> 00:03:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}HOWEVER...</b></font>

64
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A funeral is to be held tomorrow
in Motoyoshi Village</font>

65
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the head of the Kagetsu family
that owns that stretch of mountains.</font>

66
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like you two to go.</font>

67
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Funeral security, huh?
Naruto can't do it.</font>

68
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?!</font>

69
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you have
the most inappropriate face</font>

70
00:03:54,330 --> 00:03:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Leaf Village.</font>

71
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

72
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think so as well.</font>

73
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:01,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's nobody else.</font>

74
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I reluctantly decided
to add Naruto.</font>

75
00:04:06,010 --> 00:04:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be the main guy
on this mission, Shino.</font>

76
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're probably the best suited
for this mission.</font>

77
00:04:14,230 --> 00:04:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As it happens,</font>

78
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:17,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's one more important mission
in addition to security.</font>

79
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll understand when
you see the will.</font>

80
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, in the event that Futa raises
his voice in laughter at the funeral,</font>

81
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he shall lose inheriting rights
and upon consultation,</font>

82
00:04:29,370 --> 00:04:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the estate shall be divided up between the
bereaved family members excluding Futa.</font>

83
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will doesn't make any sense at all...</font>

84
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:38,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An abundance of medicinal herbs
can be picked in the mountains</font>

85
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">owned by the Kagetsu family.</font>

86
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would have no trouble getting
by for the rest of my life</font>

87
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I were to inherit the estate.</font>

88
00:04:43,670 --> 00:04:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But all that will all go down the drain
just by laughing at the funeral!</font>

89
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:51,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no doubt that the relatives
will be in a frenzy</font>

90
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">trying to get me to laugh tomorrow.</font>

91
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be honest,</font>

92
00:04:55,390 --> 00:04:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the confidence
to withstand it.</font>

93
00:05:04,490 --> 00:05:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there is one salvation!</font>

94
00:05:07,370 --> 00:05:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the will,</font>

95
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's acceptable if I, the chief mourner,
were to appoint a substitute!</font>

96
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I commissioned the Leaf!</font>

97
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I asked for someone who
absolutely will not laugh!</font>

98
00:05:17,710 --> 00:05:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no doubt the perfect mission
for Shino.</font>

99
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen
this guy laugh before.</font>

100
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, I leave it to you.</font>

101
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

102
00:05:30,050 --> 00:05:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother, dinner's ready.</font>

103
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my little sister Mai,
the youngest.</font>

104
00:05:35,890 --> 00:05:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She lived together with
my father in this large home.</font>

105
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was also the one at his deathbed
during his final moments.</font>

106
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mai, this is Shino and Naruto.</font>

107
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice to meet you...</font>

108
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!</font>

109
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

110
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:54,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll taste for poison.</font>

111
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taste for poison...?!</font>

112
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think there would be anyone
among the relatives</font>

113
00:05:58,460 --> 00:05:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would go that far...</font>

114
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you can never be too careful.</font>

115
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a point.</font>

116
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you be all right, Shino?</font>

117
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:09,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.
Even if it did contain poison,</font>

118
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the parasitic insects in
my body will dissolve it for me.</font>

119
00:06:13,930 --> 00:06:16,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Parasitic... insects?</font>

120
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is it?</font>

121
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right...</font>

122
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino... laughed?!</font>

123
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems to be in very high spirits.
Which means the food is fine...</font>

124
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't eat!</font>

125
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino laughing like
this is definitely strange!</font>

126
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a laughing drug in this food!</font>

127
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cooked the food?</font>

128
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did.</font>

129
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:11,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the back door isn't locked...</font>

130
00:07:11,820 --> 00:07:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So anyone could get in if they wanted to.</font>

131
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think there would be
someone in the family</font>

132
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would go so far as to poison!</font>

133
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no...
The drug has gotten to the insects!</font>

134
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good...
They can't dissolve the drug.</font>

135
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then what will we do about
the funeral tomorrow?!</font>

136
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a sight that doesn't seem
of this world!</font>

137
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:37,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

138
00:07:39,140 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we were to
contact the village now,</font>

139
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we wouldn't be in time...
for the funeral...</font>

140
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Naruto!</font>

141
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

142
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will have to participate in the funeral
as the chief mourner's substitute!</font>

143
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

144
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

145
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:01,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm very uneasy,
but I'll be counting on you.</font>

146
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm also very uneasy...</font>

147
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you knock it off?! I can't sleep!</font>

148
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're early, Tsukiko.</font>

149
00:08:23,690 --> 00:08:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're already here, huh?</font>

150
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dad's funeral, after all.
I came here in great haste.</font>

151
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that kid?</font>

152
00:08:33,610 --> 00:08:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Naruto whom I've asked to
be my substitute as chief mourner</font>

153
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:37,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since I'm not feeling so well.</font>

154
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice to meet you!</font>

155
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how it's going to be, so
I'll be leaving just with the greetings.</font>

156
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. But it sure is a troublesome will.</font>

157
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you can't inherit the estate
if you laugh at the funeral...</font>

158
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful.</font>

159
00:08:53,970 --> 00:08:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's my immediate younger sister
in question, Tsukiko.</font>

160
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five years ago,
she married into the next village over...</font>

161
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But she's probably the one
after this estate the most.</font>

162
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid will be a cinch.</font>

163
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Each and every one of them...
looks greedy...</font>

164
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that...?</font>

165
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The monk has arrived.</font>

166
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why choose a monk like this,
of all people?</font>

167
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no knowledge of this!</font>

168
00:09:55,570 --> 00:09:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a different person from
the monk at the meeting.</font>

169
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh...</font>

170
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh...</font>

171
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:10,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laugh... Laugh... Laugh...</font>

172
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, allow me to begin.</font>

173
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that sound?</font>

174
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:28,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't it the wind blowing?</font>

175
00:10:29,730 --> 00:10:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, did you not raise your voice
and laugh just now?</font>

176
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I didn't!
I didn't laugh at all!</font>

177
00:10:35,730 --> 00:10:37,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mai, you heard it, right?</font>

178
00:10:37,950 --> 00:10:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

179
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I only heard the sound of
barrels falling over.</font>

180
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, fine.</font>

181
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The funeral has only just begun.</font>

182
00:10:47,830 --> 00:10:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are still plenty of chances...</font>

183
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, the opponent is this kid
with a stupid look.</font>

184
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saved...</font>

185
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino, huh? Thanks!</font>

186
00:11:05,310 --> 00:11:06,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a close shave...</font>

187
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order, please.</font>

188
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll go first.</font>

189
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laugh... Laugh... Laugh...</font>

190
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good... He won't laugh at that...</font>

191
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it one more push.</font>

192
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh...!</font>

193
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not laugh!</font>

194
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid is nothing.</font>

195
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill him with laughter with
that technique of mine...</font>

196
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy also intends on
doing something, huh?</font>

197
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what he does,
no way will I laugh!</font>

198
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiyoyasu!</font>

199
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Kiyoyasu!
— Kiyoyasu is...</font>

200
00:11:57,940 --> 00:11:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it comes...</font>

201
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever he hits me with, I...!</font>

202
00:12:05,530 --> 00:12:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not laugh!</font>

203
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laugh... Laugh... Laugh...</font>

204
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A flower came out...</font>

205
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh...!</font>

206
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:20,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laugh... Laugh... Laugh...</font>

207
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh, don't laugh, don't laugh...</font>

208
00:12:30,770 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Laugh... Laugh... Laugh...</font>

209
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't laugh... no matter what!</font>

210
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty tough...</font>

211
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:43,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how long can he hold on for?</font>

212
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll make him laugh by the time
the funeral ends without fail!</font>

213
00:12:57,710 --> 00:12:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That... old woman...</font>

214
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dead people also laugh
in Motoyoshi Village...</font>

215
00:13:03,590 --> 00:13:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be all over if you're lured
into laughing.</font>

216
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's she doing in a place like this?</font>

217
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?!</font>

218
00:13:12,540 --> 00:13:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, oh!</font>

219
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's you Mai...</font>

220
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, it's over!
We'll put this in everyone's tea!</font>

221
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

222
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything will go well with this!</font>

223
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that.</font>

224
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

225
00:13:52,140 --> 00:13:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino...</font>

226
00:13:58,850 --> 00:14:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard everything...</font>

227
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How frustrating...</font>

228
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this guy would just laugh,
I'd get some of the estate...</font>

229
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you indeed for today.
Allow me to thank you all...</font>

230
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:22,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in place of the chief mourner.</font>

231
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, the mission is complete...</font>

232
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like it will somehow
end all right.</font>

233
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once the monk goes home,
the funeral will be over.</font>

234
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait!</font>

235
00:14:34,430 --> 00:14:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let my husband say
thank you as well. Okay, dear.</font>

236
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi! Thanks for coming today.</font>

237
00:14:53,950 --> 00:14:56,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he going to do?!</font>

238
00:14:56,160 --> 00:15:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a very nice funeral.
I was so moved!</font>

239
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's tear-jerking.</font>

240
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Tsukiko...
To think she would go this far.</font>

241
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, if you can get through this,
it will be over.</font>

242
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:17,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please withstand it...!</font>

243
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:21,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't hurt at all!</font>

244
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must remember something sad
at a time like this!</font>

245
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do I think of the Pervy Sage
at a time like this?!</font>

246
00:15:30,030 --> 00:15:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, now is the time
to finish him off.</font>

247
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is awful!
The tears are causing my face to collapse.</font>

248
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about?</font>

249
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your face... is right here!</font>

250
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

251
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no...</font>

252
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

253
00:15:52,090 --> 00:15:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

254
00:16:00,230 --> 00:16:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad...</font>

255
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're alive? Dad?!</font>

256
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Big Brother, Big Sister!</font>

257
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad hates fighting!</font>

258
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've thought up a good joke.</font>

259
00:16:14,410 --> 00:16:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've thought up a good joke, too.</font>

260
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are those kids...?
Where did they come from?</font>

261
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:22,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd get Dad to laugh first!</font>

262
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be the first! You stay out of it!</font>

263
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! Fighting's wrong!</font>

264
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as Mai says.
Fighting's wrong! Wrong.</font>

265
00:16:32,930 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Futa! Tsukiko!</font>

266
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Futa?!
— Tsukiko?!</font>

267
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it...</font>

268
00:16:39,430 --> 00:16:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... They are indeed us
from our childhood!</font>

269
00:16:44,650 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, fighting's wrong! A kettle's a kettle!</font>

270
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My mom dislikes ponkan mandarins!</font>

271
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:55,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Groping is wrong!
Hot sake is where it's at.</font>

272
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My wife's secret stash is kept in a safe.</font>

273
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Between my legs...</font>

274
00:17:00,990 --> 00:17:02,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ding, dong, ding.</font>

275
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, ding-dong-ding.
Yeah, ding-dong-ding.</font>

276
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, ding-dong-ding.
Yeah, ding-dong-ding.</font>

277
00:17:09,290 --> 00:17:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, ding-dong-ding.</font>

278
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ding-dong.</font>

279
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That's right...
— Ding-dong. Ding-dong.</font>

280
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— When we were kids...
— Ding. Yeah, ding-dong-ding.</font>

281
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Dad made us laugh a lot
— Ding-dong-ding.</font>

282
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— with his silly jokes...
— Ding-dong.</font>

283
00:17:19,810 --> 00:17:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's been a long time
— Ding. Ding.</font>

284
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— since I laughed at dad's jokes...
— Dong-dong-dong. Dong</font>

285
00:17:23,230 --> 00:17:26,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Dong-dong.
— This is it! This is what I wanted to see!</font>

286
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad!</font>

287
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then who's this?</font>

288
00:17:43,830 --> 00:17:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The laughter stopped.</font>

289
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

290
00:17:46,870 --> 00:17:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, everyone!</font>

291
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I didn't think you'd all come
if it weren't my funeral...</font>

292
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mai helped me out a bunch
and this was the plan.</font>

293
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that really you, Dad? You're alive.</font>

294
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd you do this?!</font>

295
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the old days,
before we knew that</font>

296
00:18:07,890 --> 00:18:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the medicinal herbs we could pick
in the mountains would be profitable...</font>

297
00:18:10,730 --> 00:18:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were poor...</font>

298
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we were bursting with laughter.</font>

299
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, we got rich from selling
the medicinal herbs at a high price.</font>

300
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when we'd open our mouths,</font>

301
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:27,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'd start saying,
"Money! Money! Money!"</font>

302
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the smiles vanished from
everyone's faces.</font>

303
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted everyone to remember
what's important.</font>

304
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to get back
the family's smiling faces!</font>

305
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I wrote that ridiculous will,</font>

306
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">everyone would do stupid things
trying to get Futa to laugh.</font>

307
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then not only Futa,
but everyone would laugh and have fun...</font>

308
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Happiness isn't money!</font>

309
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's living while getting along
with everyone and laughing!</font>

310
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember...</font>

311
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, laughter is important.</font>

312
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

313
00:19:07,370 --> 00:19:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be honest, I'm sick of living
at the mercy of money.</font>

314
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You liar! You're the one saying
money this and money that the most.</font>

315
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are different kinds of "money,"
and what I was talking about was...</font>

316
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This bell.</font>

317
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could that be...?</font>

318
00:19:39,610 --> 00:19:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the laughing drug.</font>

319
00:19:41,530 --> 00:19:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still at an experimental stage, though.</font>

320
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I made it okay to appoint
a substitute chief mourner,</font>

321
00:19:46,830 --> 00:19:51,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Futa would summon someone
who definitely wouldn't laugh.</font>

322
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I tested it out on that person first.</font>

323
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was going to make everyone laugh
by putting this in everyone's tea</font>

324
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if nobody had laughed by
the end of the funeral.</font>

325
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

326
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point to laughter
using a drug...</font>

327
00:20:09,930 --> 00:20:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because the people
wouldn't be laughing</font>

328
00:20:11,730 --> 00:20:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the bottom of their hearts.</font>

329
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead,
they'd be crying in their hearts...</font>

330
00:20:21,030 --> 00:20:22,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like me right now!</font>

331
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So at the end of the day,
what happened with the mission?</font>

332
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably a success.</font>

333
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because the Hokage-sama probably
knew about the real mission.</font>

334
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,210
